@@ -0,0 +1,5 @@
+Resolved a redirect ``Location`` with the scheme of the current URL but
+without ``//``, such as ``http:/path`` or ``http:path``, against the
+current URL, as browsers do, instead of treating it as an absolute URL
+without a host
+-- by :user:`asvetlov`.
